      "t": "위기는 기회니까 그렇게 불안하지 않아요.",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "You picked up how to say 'I can't go', an expressive phrase for when it's freezing to death, and the proverb 'crisis is opportunity'. Back to the meeting room next!",
      "gap": 0.5
